<title>USA: Millipore says Amicon accretive by mid-97.</title>
<headline>Millipore says Amicon accretive by mid-97.</headline>
<dateline>BEDFORD, Mass. 1996-11-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Millipore Inc said on Monday that its planned acquisition of W.R. Grace &amp; Co's Amicon unit was expected to be accretive to earnings by mid-1997.</p>
<p>The company said it entered into an agreement to buy Amicon from W.R. Grace for $125 million in cash. Amicon makes and distributes protein purification tools for the research laboratory and for biotechnology manufacturing.</p>
<p>Millipore applies its purification technology to research and manufacturing problems.</p>
</text>
